                                "sense_id": "e6adde25-0df2-3e5f-9bc3-1753aa4d0cf4",
                                "text": "The Monte Cristo and Philadelphia sphalerites have similar mean Pb concentrations (80 ppm) that are lower than the Lucky Dog sphalerites (119 ppm)."
                            }
                        ]
